record('radio-case', 'Delhi Police radio tenders: vendor-specific clauses → repeated single bids → price negotiation', 'CAG found the 2011–2019 upgrade proposal and tender specifications insufficiently justified, including reversals of pre-bid amendments; the 2018 tender drew only Motorola and was scrapped. PAC140 records a technology-neutral retender approved in 2022, again with one bidder. PAC32 records Mobile Communication India’s 27 August 2024 bid at ₹185 crore inclusive of taxes against a ₹120 crore estimate; negotiation was being examined. Neither a ₹65 crore loss nor an award is established.', ['cag-comms-2020','pac140-2024','pac32-2025'], ['delhi-police','mha','radio-upgrade','motorola-named','mobile-communication','cag','pac'], ['radio-motorola','radio-mci','radio-mha'], 'Delhi Police justified same-maker requirements by acceptance-testing concerns; CAG disagreed with that explanation. Later Government replies describe the technology-neutral RFP and continuing evaluation/negotiation, not a finalized payment. No vendor-specific reply was located.', date='2025-08-05', period='2011–2019 tender design; 2022–2024 retender; 30 January 2025 response tabled 5 August 2025', alternatives=['Compatibility/testing and limited qualified competition may help explain a single bid; price above estimate is not itself overpricing or bribery.'], limitations=['No later award/cancellation/payment was found in the bounded search through 7 October 2026. The ₹102 crore 2022 approximate tender approval and ₹120 crore 2024 estimate are distinct dated figures, not reconciled or added.'])
record('radio-response', 'Radio procurement: technology-neutral retender and latest quoted-price stage', 'PAC32 reproduces the Ministry’s final response: qualified bidder price opened 27 August 2024; ₹185 crore including taxes versus ₹120 crore estimated cost including taxes, with negotiation being examined.', ['pac140-2024','pac32-2025'], ['delhi-police','mha','mobile-communication'], ['radio-mci'], 'Explicitly a bid/estimate comparison; no established overpayment.', kind='departmental-response', date='2025-08-05', amounts=[amount(185,'crore','quoted bid including taxes; not award or payment','27 August 2024'),amount(120,'crore','departmental estimate including taxes; not expenditure','2024 tender price comparison')])
